  "description": "Unofficial fork of zxing-cpp 3.1.1 / ZXingCpp 0.5.3. Linear barcode detection at arbitrary rotation (plus/minus 45 degrees) with sub-pixel scan lines and full bar-height position rects; small-module fallback (fixed threshold + Lanczos x2 upscale); faster through multi-threading and SSE2; extra QR recall for laser-etched / specular-highlight codes. Multi-targeted: net461, net48, netstandard2.0, netcoreapp2.0, net5.0, net8.0-windows. Managed layer ships the enhanced helpers used in the demo: BarcodeScanner, ScanResult, BarcodeInfo, and Barcode.Rotation/Orientation/LineCount/Points, plus ImageView(IntPtr). Use this package INSTEAD of ZXingCpp, not together with it.",
  "id": "ZXingCpp.Angle",
